      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "vague"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "In the early 1900s, Lillie's economy relied on timber extraction from pine forests, with small sawmills and logging camps supporting local jobs.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
